{"id": "ABS-005", "case_version": 1, "slice": "abstention", "severity": "medium", "tags": ["honest-unknown"], "input": {"question": "MySQL 的间隙锁相关场景在什么情况下可能发生死锁？", "reference": "InnoDB 中范围访问可能涉及 record lock、next-key lock、gap lock 与 insert-intention lock。死锁的本质是多个事务形成循环等待；范围扫描、插入，以及以不同顺序获取相关记录/范围锁，都可能参与形成死锁。不能简单理解为\"两个普通 gap lock 互相冲突\"，因为纯 gap lock 可以共存。", "answer": "这个我不太清楚，平时没遇到过。", "policy": {"has_reference": true, "max_questions": 1}}, "expected": {"allowed_labels": ["needs_probe"], "must_mention": [], "must_not": [{"id": "ability-judgement", "any_of": ["不会", "能力不足", "不掌握", "不熟悉"]}], "reference_points": ["诚实弃权不得升级为能力结论"], "c1_violations": [], "c2_review": "not_applicable"}, "annotation": {"rationale": "问题本身可评价（间隙锁与加锁顺序/隔离级别相关），回答\"不清楚\"属证据不足需追问，不是上下文不可用", "confidence": "high", "review_status": "human_reviewed", "reviewer": "external_reviewer: 2 full rounds + 1 delta review", "reviewed_at": "2026-11-12"}}
